Comment: 9,0:23:28.93,0:23:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.99,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my imprisonment has taught me
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.28,0:00:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,how stupid I've been until now.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't keep my greed in check
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.08,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and I stole many times.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of who I was.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to change thanks to you, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me get\Nparole.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Recent studies have shown
Dialogue: 9,0:00:28.60,0:00:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that with proper training,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,even dogs and parrots\Ncan learn to read, make a fire
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and understand art.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.77,0:00:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.09,0:00:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what difference is there\Nbetween man and animal?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:41.73,0:00:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.82,0:00:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But, about my parole...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.44,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.87,0:00:53.91,TiretsDefault,,859,0,0,,– But...\N– I've got it.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea is to avoid the pit\Nof the first cherry
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.63,0:01:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,while eating the second one.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:05.61,0:01:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not biting into the first pit\Nwhen eating the second cherry.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:11.51,0:01:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you think of my parole?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's possible.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:18.81,0:01:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Father?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:20.23,0:01:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give your name to the committee.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:24.23,0:01:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fa...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:30.61,0:01:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to like you.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never learn, will you?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A disposition toward evil\Ncan never be corrected.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:39.83,0:01:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mustn't reject\Nthat talent of yours.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be useful to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:46.34,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Jotaro's Stand
Dialogue: 9,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,leave this prison, after all.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:33.28,0:03:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you mean, F.F. is hiding it?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.70,0:03:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that disc was important,\Nthat it contained your father's Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it bother you\Nnot to know where she's hiding it?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.50,0:03:46.21,TiretsDefault,,572,0,0,,– We don't know if we can trust her...\N– This place is great!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.88,TiretsDefault,,556,0,0,,– So different from the swamps!\N– Let's calm down.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play too.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We do say "playing catch", right?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.43,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and Whitesnake doesn't know\Nshe's alive.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.51,0:04:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the safest way.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But what would be even better
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.81,TiretsDefault,,546,0,0,,– would be to give it back to him.\N– I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:11.94,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed any visits\Nor phone calls
Dialogue: 9,0:04:15.11,0:04:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,because of my escape attempt.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't figured out\Nhow to get the disc out.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my cup!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty, I'm just taking a sip.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.92,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that cup back on the bench!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you leave it there\Nif it's so important to you?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful around here.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:43.60,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Foo Fighters, I'll bring you water!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.44,0:04:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a mess!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give that back!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have more water than before.\NI'm lucky.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,let's get back to our game.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.34,TiretsDefault,,846,0,0,,– Well, well.\N– What?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.55,0:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never thrown a ball, have you?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuck your hips in.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.73,0:05:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A little more.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already playing better.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, did you know
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.37,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we've just thrown the ball 86 times
Dialogue: 9,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,without dropping it once?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to 100!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,100 dollars says you drop it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.67,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet 100 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but who are you?\NAnd what do you mean, 100 dollars?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Miraschon,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.72,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,inmate FE26789.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you 100 dollars
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.02,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't make it to the 100th throw.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.98,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.65,0:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just killing time.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 13 throws left!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.54,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have that kind of money.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bet that much.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can bet anything.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes, medication,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:40.34,0:06:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,chewing gum, phone calls,\Na massage vibrator...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept anything of value.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be clearer.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I never gamble.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,we should take that bet.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.52,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We could make some money.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my money.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.15,0:07:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F. might be useless,\Nbut at this rate, we'll win.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.45,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's a trap\Nset by Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:09.99,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm on the same floor as Miraschon,\NI know her well.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.75,0:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a small-time crook,\Na kleptomaniac.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:19.84,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even once your punishment is lifted,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.51,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll need money\Nto make phone calls.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,are we playing or not?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.10,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play! We can win!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.27,0:07:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't have 100 dollars,\Ndo you?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:42.07,0:07:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cause trouble or get too close,\Nthe bet is off.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It has already started.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:51.16,0:07:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But it would be unfair to me
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,if you stood too close\Nor held the ball too long.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stay three meters apart\Nand throw within ten seconds.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.58,0:08:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play, come on!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time to aim.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.47,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have ten seconds to throw.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.05,0:08:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 89!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.93,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 11 throws to go!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.81,0:08:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from my cup, bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.78,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my fault!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.91,0:08:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to take my cup!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.87,0:08:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just looking.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.75,0:08:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from my cup, I said!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more seconds.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., throw the ball!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.75,TiretsDefault,,631,0,0,,– Damn it, she's distracting me!\N– Hey!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your cup.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.84,TiretsDefault,,681,0,0,,– One second left.\N– Hurry up!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.26,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.98,0:09:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was close, but she got it!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to focus.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See? A hundred throws!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.83,0:09:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.08,0:09:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do 100 more.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See? That was an easy bet.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.09,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over your 100 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:24.59,0:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she bet with F.F. too.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:27.59,0:09:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes 200 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. She owes us 200 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough up the bills.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One more zero if you can't do\Nanother 100 throws.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:41.27,0:09:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me right.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.69,0:09:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm betting 1,000 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.40,0:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even have that much?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.32,0:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But like I said,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I also accept\Nanything of value.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Same rules as last time.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:56.58,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:58.29,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm done playing with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be clear.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something fishy about you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:07.88,0:10:10.76,TiretsDefault,,491,0,0,,– If you want to bet, go play somewhere else...\N– Deal.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:12.51,0:10:15.05,TiretsDefault,,507,0,0,,– F.F., give me the glove and the ball.\N– Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, no!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.35,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, she's suspicious.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.81,0:10:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially with her habit\Nof insisting on betting.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,MINT
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.78,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we could make 1,200 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.07,0:10:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pass up such an opportunity.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.74,0:10:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The game begins\Nthe moment you agree to play.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds go by fast.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.16,TiretsDefault,,828,0,0,,– Hermes!\N– F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.58,0:10:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,More easy money.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.55,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.51,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-one.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-two.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.68,0:10:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, the next one will be the 33rd.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:59.97,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmates,\Nput down your recreational equipment.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.52,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Recreation time is over!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Five...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.48,0:11:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.07,0:11:14.19,TiretsDefault,,772,0,0,,– Thirty-three!\N– Bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you behave!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.04,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The bet is off. Understood?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine a meteorite\Nfalling straight from the sky
Dialogue: 9,0:11:23.83,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,onto this courtyard at this very moment.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:26.62,0:11:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help it,\Nit's the meteorite's fault.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you'd say
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to convince yourself,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,not to convince me.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But does that work for you?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.35,0:11:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you took too long
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to throw the ball.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can honestly say
Dialogue: 9,0:11:49.82,0:11:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't break\Nthe rules of the game,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,then of course,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,back out of the bet.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:56.91,0:11:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.70,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to end up in the punitive ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:04.37,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.96,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me five... no, three minutes.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:10.58,0:12:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do another round,\Nfinish up in two minutes.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., hurry!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.13,0:12:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But your 100 dollars\Nonly cover the ball.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the glove back. Hand it over!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:27.64,0:12:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I stuck a sticker on it{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for this kind of situation!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:46.79,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep playing.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just watching.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.72,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't interfere.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:04.10,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't prove it, but...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows what she did.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt
Dialogue: 9,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,she just broke\Nthe rules of the game.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I know it,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.53,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because Marilyn Manson,\Nthe debt collector, has appeared.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a Stand user!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.80,0:13:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Marilyn Manson collects debts
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter where the money is hidden.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Money, or anything of value.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:48.10,0:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.56,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:53.77,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.99,0:14:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.63,0:14:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I sell this liver on the black market,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.13,0:14:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it will cover the remaining 590 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.55,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.18,0:14:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.47,0:14:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the shadow of Hermes' conscience.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.48,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hurt me.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.94,0:14:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes broke the rules\Nand lost the bet.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I only collected her debt.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have anything else of value,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to trade her liver\Nfor it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The game isn't over.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.29,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand throws.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:53.71,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.05,0:14:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you give back everything you took from her.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.72,0:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. But I hope you're ready
Dialogue: 9,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to stake something of equal value.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.68,0:15:07.80,TiretsDefault,,784,0,0,,– Got it.\N– Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The game has begun.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.69,0:15:19.44,TiretsDefault,,850,0,0,,– Jolyne.\N– Hermes,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:19.65,0:15:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.98,0:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miraschon is a Stand user.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.32,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake must be behind all this.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:27.24,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's surely here to take\Nmy father's disc from me.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:32.62,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't play this game.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:36.71,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're caught up\Nin my problem with my father.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you die.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand throws? That's impossible!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:46.93,0:15:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This Stand looks invincible.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.10,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.72,0:15:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to beat Miraschon, the user!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.43,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stand might be invincible,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but Miraschon isn't.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she left.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.53,0:16:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:15.63,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have entered this room.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a door in the back.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She could have escaped through there.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, don't throw!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:30.80,0:16:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.! The ball is coming toward you!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.94,0:16:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.10,0:16:36.89,TiretsDefault,,738,0,0,,– I can't see a thing!\N– Don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball is going to hit you!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.57,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I've got it!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.74,0:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.37,0:16:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now calm down and throw.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.62,0:16:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.70,TiretsDefault,,823,0,0,,– Where?\N– Hurry!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're done for.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.04,0:17:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for this crap!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Foo Fighters
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,toward her voice.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even aim!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.10,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it! What is her power?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lockdown is about to begin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:28.28,0:17:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All inmates to their cells.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prepare for roll call.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:40.08,0:17:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She went right!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.84,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really too bad.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.97,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cornered.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know you have a Stand,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:58.31,0:17:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back my punches.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.98,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:01.44,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give everything back.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.73,0:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The liver
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.90,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and the money!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.11,0:18:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.61,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave you that Stand?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:10.49,0:18:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.61,0:18:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was him, wasn't it?\NI want to know who his user is.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.46,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanted\Nwas to get out on parole!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:32.80,0:18:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A freight elevator.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.35,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It carries food from the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How many seconds do you have left?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.85,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Six...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, five?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Two seconds...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:55.49,0:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., the ball!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it to me!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.25,0:19:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What will be your next choice?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight seconds.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.97,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven, six...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:18.68,0:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F.!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Miraschon?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.86,0:19:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so easy.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.45,0:19:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to ask me again.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The game...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:49.21,0:19:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,has been interrupted.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:57.59,0:20:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Marilyn Manson takes everything,\Nno matter the cost!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever it is,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:03.52,0:20:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it's lost,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.44,0:20:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Marilyn knows where it is.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:07.48,0:20:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your most expensive organ,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and the remaining debt will be covered
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.11,0:20:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,by your most precious item,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,your father's disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.20,0:20:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that disc...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.99,0:20:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,is being hidden by that woman!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.37,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:28.96,0:20:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your organ,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.79,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,your disc...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.01,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,are mine now!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:38.09,0:20:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is far from over.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.81,0:20:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.27,0:20:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.49,0:21:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.45,TiretsDefault,,628,0,0,,– You broke the rules.\N– No.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:03.66,0:21:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We never specified\Nwho I had to play with.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.25,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can play with a guard.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The debt collector agrees.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.09,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How many throws do I have left?\NEight hundred?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine hundred?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.77,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Too hard to count.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say 1,000 throws.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:56.25,0:21:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give my father his disc back.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.55,0:22:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also get him the disc\Nheld by Whitesnake,
Dialogue: 9,0:22:02.64,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what it costs me.
